# Applies a design that adds the length `x` and points the child's range at it,
# then a design that replaces `x` with a duration and sets the length `L` to the
# range. The range reaches the duration once the second design applies, so the
# second design can't set `L` to it.

submodel parent as p

apply range_to_added_length to p
apply length_to_range_after_readd to p
